{"repositoryId":1218371207,"availability":"available","full":"peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service","name":"garbigo_auth-service","description":"Spring User Authentication Service for Smart garbage system","category":"Other","language":"Java","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-22T20:07:55Z","updated":"2026-10-19T22:04:18Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://developers.google.com/oauthplayground","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.009Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.009Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.009Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.009Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#security-highlights) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#security-highlights) [](#getting-started) [](#license)","[](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#api-reference)","Garbigo Auth Service is the authentication and identity microservice powering Garbigo, a Smart Garbage SaaS platform connecting clients with waste collectors. It owns everything related to who a user is: sign up, sign in, social login, email verification, password recovery, profile management, roles, and the social layer (follows, likes, reviews, profile views) that sits on top of a user's identity."],"features":["Email + password sign up and sign in, with account-status-aware error messages (unverified / inactive / archived all get a distinct, actionable response)","Social sign-in via Google, Facebook, and GitHub — sign up and sign in are the same request; an unrecognized email creates the account","Stateless JWT access tokens (sub, userId, jti, iat, exp) with a Redis-backed revocation denylist, so logout actually invalidates the token instead of just discarding it client-side","Email verification with resend, and forgot-password / reset-password flows, both backed by short-lived, single-use tokens","Change password for authenticated users"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"93e826ae362f56d2b6fa56fd03a9cb18f74099d08fc3f95e675bd7985bfc89ad","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.150Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.150Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#security-highlights) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](#security-highlights) [](#getting-started) [](#license)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Social Login Google and Facebook","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Verifying a Social Login","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The client only ever sees a short-lived, single-use code — exchanging it for a real access token has to happen server-side, since that step requires the client secret.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"no token needed valid Bearer token required ADMIN role required X-Internal-Api-Key header required, no user token","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"93e826ae362f56d2b6fa56fd03a9cb18f74099d08fc3f95e675bd7985bfc89ad","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.151Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T22:04:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/peacemakerbill/garbigo_auth-service/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:55.155Z","hash":"93e826ae362f56d